==Description==
The '''CandyCane Nametag''' is a nametag that can be obtained from the [[Quests#Oh So Sweet!|Oh So Sweet!]] quest, which requires 250 [[Gingerbread (Krampus Frosthold)|Gingerbreads]] to be killed.

The '''CandyCane Nametag''' has alternating white and red text.

